/T (Revenue models include direct sales, leasing and Robot-as-a-Service, with payment by month, operating hour or completed task. Software licences, maintenance and upgrades may add recurring income. The difficulty is timing: research, certification, tooling, inventory, installation and field support are funded before volume economics are visible. Custom engineering at each site can also erode hardware margins.)
