389 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 82 0 R
/T (The United States has the deepest pool of private capital, strong cloud providers and a willingness to finance platform businesses before profit. Companies such as Figure AI, Apptronik, Agility Robotics, Skild AI and Physical Intelligence are often viewed as combinations of hardware, software, data and foundation models. Stanford HAI's AI Index 2026 recorded USD 285.9 billion of US private AI investment in 2025, against USD 12.4 billion in China. These figures cover AI as a whole, not Physical AI, but they show the financing capacity available to American companies. High valuations can fund speed; they can also outrun commercial maturity.)
/E (The United States has the deepest pool of private capital, strong cloud providers and a willingness to finance platform businesses before profit. Companies such as Figure AI, Apptronik, Agility Robotics, Skild AI and Physical Intelligence are often viewed as combinations of hardware, software, data and foundation models. Stanford HAI's AI Index 2026 recorded USD 285.9 billion of US private AI investment in 2025, against USD 12.4 billion in China. These figures cover AI as a whole, not Physical AI, but they show the financing capacity available to American companies. High valuations can fund speed; they can also outrun commercial maturity.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
