/E (China combines public policy, manufacturing groups, local supply chains and a large domestic market. The International Federation of Robotics' World Robotics 2026 report, published on 24 September, counted 354,000 industrial robots installed in China in 2025, 59 per cent of a global total of 603,000. Chinese brands supplied 55 per cent of their home market.)
