/T (Generative Bionics was founded in July 2024 by former Italian Institute of Technology \(IIT\) researchers and is led by Daniele Pucci. It received exclusive licences to technologies developed through IIT's humanoid programmes. In December 2025 it closed a EUR 70 million round led by CDP Venture Capital's Artificial Intelligence Fund, with AMD Ventures, Duferco, Eni Next, RoboIT and Tether. CDP and IIT said the proceeds would support product development, Physical AI training, industrial validation and a first production plant. The valuation, equity sold and governance terms were not disclosed.)
