/Title (NEURA Robotics is further along financially. It raised EUR 120 million in a Series B led by Lingotto Investment Management in January 2025. On 10 June 2026, it announced a Series C of up to USD 1.4 billion led by Tether, with Qualcomm, Amazon, NVIDIA, imec.xpand, Bosch, Schaeffler, the European Investment Bank, Lingotto Horizon and InterAlpen among the backers.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2029 0 R
/Next 2050 0 R
>>
endobj
2050 0 obj
<<
/Title (The words "up to" establish a maximum, not proof that the full amount arrived at closing. The public releases we reviewed do not show the investor-by-investor allocation or how much is funded, committed, tranched or conditional. Bloomberg put the valuation at about USD 7 billion; NEURA's official release did not state one.)
